docs {
  # Get TACOTS Feedback Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single TACOTS scholarship programme feedback submission by its unique identifier.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                        |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the feedback submission    |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete TACOTS feedback record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                          | Type     | Description                                                       |
  |--------------------------------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                             | string   | UUID primary key.                                                 |
  | studentFirstName               | string   | Student's first name.                                             |
  | studentSurname                 | string   | Student's surname.                                                |
  | currentSchool                  | string   | Student's current school.                                         |
  | currentClass                   | string   | Student's current class/grade.                                    |
  | scholarshipHelpedStay          | string   | Whether the scholarship helped the student stay in school.        |
  | mostHelpfulSupport             | string[] | Types of support found most helpful (nullable).                   |
  | studyMotivationRating          | number   | Study motivation rating (1–5).                                    |
  | mentorshipImpactRating         | number   | Mentorship impact rating (1–5).                                   |
  | currentChallenges              | string[] | Current challenges faced by the student (nullable).               |
  | likedMost                      | string   | What the student liked most about the programme (nullable).       |
  | studentImprovementSuggestions  | string   | Student's suggestions for improvement (nullable).                 |
  | parentGuardianName             | string   | Parent/guardian's full name.                                      |
  | parentGuardianRelationship     | string   | Relationship to the student.                                      |
  | parentPhone                    | string   | Parent/guardian phone number (nullable).                           |
  | scholarshipReducedBurden       | string   | Whether the scholarship reduced financial burden.                 |
  | academicImprovementNoticed     | string   | Academic improvement noticed by parent (nullable).                |
  | attitudeChangeNoticed          | string   | Attitude changes noticed (nullable).                              |
  | parentSatisfactionRating       | number   | Parent satisfaction rating (1–5, nullable).                       |
  | programImpactOnFamily          | string   | Programme impact on the family (nullable).                        |
  | parentImprovementSuggestions   | string   | Parent's suggestions for improvement (nullable).                  |
  | additionalComments             | string   | Any additional comments (nullable).                               |
  | updatedAt                      | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                     |
  | createdAt                      | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                            |
  | deletedAt                      | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                        |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
